  "fullContentHtml": "\n<div class=\"ast-post-format- single-layout-1 ast-no-date-box\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n\n<p><!-- .entry-header --></p>\n<div class=\"entry-content clear\" style=\"height: auto !important;\">\n<div class=\"post-desc\">\n<p style=\"text-align: justify;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Short Information :</strong> <a style=\"color: #ff0000;\" href=\"https://uppbpb.gov.in/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB</a>) </span>has recently published the official notification regarding the UP Police Online Time Registration (OTR) 2025 on the official website of UPPRPB. For which the details for UP Police OTR One Time Registration Online Form 2025 has been provided on this page. As per the notification released by the UPPRPB, it has been instructed to the aspirants who are applying for the upcoming vacancies in near future that they must have to complete their OTR Registration Process in website before applying for the UP Police New Vacancies. Candidates must check the complete details &amp; process for UP Police OTR One Time Registration 2025 which has given below.</span></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-2\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable1\">\n<table style=\"font-size: 16px; font-style: normal; width: 100%;\" width=\"100%\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\">Uttar Pradesh Police Recruitment &amp; Promotion Board (UPPRPB)</span></h2>\n<h2 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #008000;\">UP Police OTR Registration 2025</span></h2>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Important Dates</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Application Start Date : <strong>31 July 2025</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt;\">Last Date for Registration :&nbsp;<b>NA</b></span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>Application Fee</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">General, EWS, OBC <strong>: 0/-</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">SC, ST <strong>: 0/</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\"><strong>No Application Fee for Any Candidates</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Candidates only have to register themselves.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Police OTR Registration 2025 : Age Limit</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Constable : <strong>18 – 22 Years&nbsp;</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Sub-Inspector (SI) : <strong>21 -28 Years</strong>&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Other posts : As per official Advertisement</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Age Relaxation as per UP Police Recruitment Rules.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Use <span style=\"background-color: #ffff00;\"> </span>Tool – </span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><b>UP Police OTR 2025 : Educational Qualification</b></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Any Candidates who are going to apply for any of the UP Police New Recruitment 2025-26 can register themselves in UP Police Website which helps to candidates to save their time.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All candidates must read the official information completely before applying.</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Police OTR Registration 2025 : Benefits</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Applicant Needs to Fill Personal Details Only Once.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Applicant Needs to Upload Documents Only Once.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">OTR Information is Digitally Available Anytime Anywhere.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Information Get Automatically Populated While Applying Under Any Commission’s Notification</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Police OTR Registration 2025 : </strong></span><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>Requisites Document of Online Application</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li data-start=\"548\" data-end=\"589\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Proof of identity (Aadhaar/Digilocker/PAN/Passport/Driving License)</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"592\" data-end=\"633\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Valid mobile number and email (for OTP verification)</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"636\" data-end=\"677\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Passport-size photograph (JPG) and scanned signature</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"680\" data-end=\"721\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Educational certificates (10th/12th mark sheets, etc.)</span></li>\n<li data-start=\"724\" data-end=\"804\"><span class=\"relative -mx-px my-[-0.2rem] rounded px-px py-[0.2rem] transition-colors duration-100 ease-in-out\" style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">Category or disability certificate, if applicable</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Police OTR Registration 2025 : Popular Vacancy</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UP Police Constable</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UP Police Sub Inspector SI</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UP Police Assistant Sub Inspector ASI</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">UP Police Computer Operator / Programmer</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\">All Other Vacancy UP Police Recruitment</span></li>\n</ul>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"pd-0\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3 style=\"text-align: center;\"><span style=\"color: #000000;\"><strong>UP Police OTR Registration 2025 : How To Apply</strong></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">In order to register for the UP Police OTR, candidates need to go to the important link section provided below.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After getting the link named as <strong>‘Register Here / New OTR Registration’</strong> candidates need to click it for doing the registration.&nbsp;</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that, Candidates will be redirected to <strong>UP Police OTR Registration</strong> Page, Here they have to click on New Registration Tab.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Now,&nbsp; they have to provide their basic details -:</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Mobile Number</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Email Id</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>DOB</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Father’s Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Mother’s Name</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"font-size: 12pt; color: #000000;\"><strong>Class 10th Roll Number etc.</strong></span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After that carefully check your OTR Profile Details &amp; then click on Submit Registration.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Now, An OTP will be received on the registered email and registered mobile number of the candidate which they have to provide for getting their registration completed.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Once the registration process gets completed, candidate will get the OTR ID, kindly take print of that page &amp; save it for your future purpose.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">Now, the candidates have to login once again to change their UP Police OTR ID Password.</span></li>\n<li><span style=\"color: #000000; font-size: 12pt;\">After following all the above listed procedure, UP Police OTR registration process will get completed, &amp; candidates may apply for any UP Police Recruitment / Exams conducted by the commission in future.</span></li>\n</ul>\n<p style=\"text-align: center;\"></p><div class=\"code-block code-block-3\" style=\"margin: 8px 0; clear: both;\">\n\n<!-- SarkariExam Home page -->\n\n</div>\n<p></p>\n</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody>\n</table>\n</div>\n<div class=\"newtable2\">\n<table style=\"width: 100%;\">\n<tbody>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><strong>Follow SarkariExam on Instagram</strong></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"has-text-align-center\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"4\" data-align=\"center\"><span style=\"color: #cc0052;\"><b>Join Our WhatsApp Channel</b></span></td>\n<td class=\"post-social-link\" style=\"text-align: center;\" colspan=\"3\" data-align=\"center\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Follow Now</a></strong></td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td style=\"text-align: center; padding: 0px;\" colspan=\"7\" width=\"100%\">\n<h3><strong>Important Links</strong></h3>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Apply Online</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://www.upprpb.in/#/auth/landing\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Download Notification</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 align=\"center\"><a href=\"https://uppbpb.gov.in/FilesUploaded/Notice/OTR-VIGY015a3b1d-8fe1-4199-a5e2-f791a5687134.pdf\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\"><strong>Click Here</strong></a></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Sarkari Exam Mobile App</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://play.google.com/store/apps/details?id=com.vinod.sarkarinaukri\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #008000;\"><strong>Join WhatsApp Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://whatsapp.com/channel/0029VaAbQf01NCrYADMLt00L\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #ff0000;\"><strong>Join Telegram Channel</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0;\"><strong><a href=\"https://t.me/sarkariresulinfo\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener nofollow\">Click Here</a></strong></h4>\n</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td class=\"tcell\" style=\"text-align: center; padding: 10px 0px;\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"56%\">\n<h4><span style=\"color: #800000;\"><strong>Official Website</strong></span></h4>\n</td>\n<td class=\"tcell\" colspan=\"4\" width=\"43%\">\n<h4 style=\"text-align: ce